  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Let's start with the simpler approach, counting.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 2440,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 73,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Our array is 2, 1, 2, 0, 2, 1, 0, 1, 0, 2.",
      "start_ms": 3080,
      "end_ms": 13180,
      "start_frame": 92,
      "end_frame": 395,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Instead of moving values immediately, we will first count how many zeros, how many ones, and how many 2s we have.",
      "start_ms": 13800,
      "end_ms": 21120,
      "start_frame": 414,
      "end_frame": 634,
      "word_count": 21
    },
    {
      "text": "We start with all three counts at 0.",
      "start_ms": 21820,
      "end_ms": 24180,
      "start_frame": 655,
      "end_frame": 725,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "First value is 2.",
      "start_ms": 24620,
      "end_ms": 25940,
      "start_frame": 739,
      "end_frame": 778,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "So count of 2 becomes 1.",
      "start_ms": 26340,
      "end_ms": 27940,
      "start_frame": 790,
      "end_frame": 838,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Next value is 1.",
      "start_ms": 27940,
      "end_ms": 29980,
      "start_frame": 838,
      "end_frame": 899,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Count of 1 becomes 1.",
      "start_ms": 30420,
      "end_ms": 31980,
      "start_frame": 913,
      "end_frame": 959,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Next value is 2.",
      "start_ms": 32480,
      "end_ms": 33780,
      "start_frame": 974,
      "end_frame": 1013,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Count of 2 becomes 2.",
      "start_ms": 34260,
      "end_ms": 35680,
      "start_frame": 1028,
      "end_frame": 1070,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Now we see 0.",
      "start_ms": 36100,
      "end_ms": 37280,
      "start_frame": 1083,
      "end_frame": 1118,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Count of 0 becomes 1.",
      "start_ms": 37860,
      "end_ms": 39620,
      "start_frame": 1136,
      "end_frame": 1189,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Next value is 2.",
      "start_ms": 40020,
      "end_ms": 41340,
      "start_frame": 1201,
      "end_frame": 1240,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Count of 2 becomes 3.",
      "start_ms": 41880,
      "end_ms": 43620,
      "start_frame": 1256,
      "end_frame": 1309,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Next value is 1.",
      "start_ms": 43980,
      "end_ms": 45200,
      "start_frame": 1319,
      "end_frame": 1356,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Count of 1 becomes 2.",
      "start_ms": 45880,
      "end_ms": 47400,
      "start_frame": 1376,
      "end_frame": 1422,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Next value is 0.",
      "start_ms": 47800,
      "end_ms": 49240,
      "start_frame": 1434,
      "end_frame": 1477,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Count of 0 becomes 2.",
      "start_ms": 49880,
      "end_ms": 51660,
      "start_frame": 1496,
      "end_frame": 1550,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Next value is 1.",
      "start_ms": 52020,
      "end_ms": 53480,
      "start_frame": 1561,
      "end_frame": 1604,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Count of 1 becomes 3.",
      "start_ms": 53780,
      "end_ms": 55400,
      "start_frame": 1613,
      "end_frame": 1662,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Next value is 0.",
      "start_ms": 55720,
      "end_ms": 57120,
      "start_frame": 1672,
      "end_frame": 1714,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Count of 0 becomes 3 and the last value is 2.",
      "start_ms": 57120,
      "end_ms": 61280,
      "start_frame": 1714,
      "end_frame": 1838,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Count of 2 becomes 4.",
      "start_ms": 61480,
      "end_ms": 63120,
      "start_frame": 1844,
      "end_frame": 1894,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "So finally, we have 3 zeros, 3 ones and 4 twos.",
      "start_ms": 63560,
      "end_ms": 68380,
      "start_frame": 1907,
      "end_frame": 2051,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Now we use these counts to rewrite the same array.",
      "start_ms": 69060,
      "end_ms": 72300,
      "start_frame": 2072,
      "end_frame": 2169,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "First, write 3 zeros, then write 3 ones.",
      "start_ms": 72960,
      "end_ms": 76700,
      "start_frame": 2189,
      "end_frame": 2301,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "And finally, write 4 twos.",
      "start_ms": 77300,
      "end_ms": 79280,
      "start_frame": 2319,
      "end_frame": 2378,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Now the array becomes 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 2.",
      "start_ms": 79280,
      "end_ms": 90360,
      "start_frame": 2378,
      "end_frame": 2711,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "So the array is correctly sorted.",
      "start_ms": 90820,
      "end_ms": 92240,
      "start_frame": 2725,
      "end_frame": 2767,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "The idea is simple.",
      "start_ms": 92520,
      "end_ms": 93380,
      "start_frame": 2776,
      "end_frame": 2801,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "First count, then rewrite.",
      "start_ms": 93720,
      "end_ms": 95220,
      "start_frame": 2812,
      "end_frame": 2857,
      "word_count": 4
    }
  ],
